                <pb facs="0277" n="177" sameAs="frus:frus1920v03/pg177"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">812.00/24468: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Chargé in Mexico</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Summerlin</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-08-18T18:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">August 18,
                                1920—6 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>207. Your August 17, noon.</p>
                <p>No promises have been made to Señor Iglesias regarding question of recognition of
                    present regime, whose contact has been confined to one or two informal talks
                    with the Undersecretary.</p>
                <p>Statement denying promises given publicity here August 17.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Colby</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
